WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:06.779
So what's the difference between management
and leadership?

00:00:06.779 --> 00:00:10.520
Management is the manipulation of others for
personal gain.

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:13.170
Think about the people who we felt
managed by.

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:15.700
Nobody wants to wake up in the morning to
be managed.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.710
We want to wake up in the morning to be led.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.800
Leadership is the responsibility,

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.320
the awesome 
responsibility to see those around us rise.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:27.040
It's a different skill set entirely.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:30.890
We're not being driven by 
how to use others so that we can get stuff.

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:34.390
We try to see ourselves, how we can use ourselves,
to help others rise.

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:35.540
That's what leadership is.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:40.220
It's much harder than management and it takes
a lot more work and a lot more studying,

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:43.100
which is why leadership really is a hard skill and

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.560
great leaders really, really, really
work at it.

